filter-graph: follow the plugins' latency ports while running

LV2 and LADSPA plugins write their latency output port in run(), but the
graph latency was computed once, right after activate(): 0 on a fresh start,
the previous instance's values after a re-activation. Check the latency
ports after each process cycle and recompute the latency in the main loop
when one changed.

Against PipeWire 1.6.10 (applies unchanged to 1.6.11).

